488 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 328 0 R
/E (Out of 50 million potential random draws, 9,975 panels cleared every benchmark. All of them were equally acceptable, so 40 panels were picked at random and assigned a number from 1 to 40. On June 11, 2026, the Connecticut Lottery used their certified lottery machine to select one ball out of the 40 they use for lottery draws. The winning number was 29. The 110 people on Panel 29 became the Assembly panel.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
