637 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 330 0 R
/E (The Assembly met six times between July and September 2026: two full weekend sessions held in person in New Haven, two additional one-day in-person sessions, and two one-day virtual sessions conducted online. In-person sessions ran roughly 9 a.m. to 5 p.m., with dinner and hotel accommodations provided for members on the two-day weekends; virtual sessions ran a shorter, roughly 9 a.m. to 1 p.m. schedule. In-person meetings were hosted on the Yale campus and at a nearby hotel in New Haven.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
638 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 330 0 R
/E (Each session followed a consistent structure of plenary presentations, panel discussions, and small-group breakout work, facilitated throughout by a professional, independent facilitation team \(KJR Consulting\).)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
