/E (Share existing restaurant and hotel tax revenue with the municipalities that generate it, to reduce reliance on the property tax. Half of the 1% meals tax would go to the municipality where the sale took place and half to the State Tourism Fund. Of the 15% room occupancy tax, 7 percentage points would go to the host municipality and 8 would remain with the state. The municipal share would be dedicated to public safety and public works.)
/Pg 29 0 R
