/E (Room occupancy tax \(15%\): The rate would remain unchanged and the revenue would be shared on nearly equal terms. Of the 15% collected, 8 percentage points would remain with the state and 7 percentage points would be returned to the municipality where the lodging is located, dedicated to public safety and public works.)
