/Title (To mitigate the impact on Connecticut drivers, lawmakers could consider reduced toll rates, credits, or other discounts for state residents and frequent users. Any such discounts would need to be evaluated for their legal and financial implications, including their effect on the amount of net revenue available for property and motor vehicle tax relief.)
