/Title (What would need to change: Implementation requires legislation directing the Department of Revenue Services to distribute the municipal shares based on where the tax is collected. The legislation would restrict the municipal share to public safety and public works, and would require each municipality to report annually on how the funds were used. No new collection system is needed, because both taxes are already collected and remitted by location.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2531 0 R
/Prev 2614 0 R
/Next 2562 0 R
>>
