/Title (How this reduces property taxes: Police, fire, emergency response and road maintenance are among the largest costs in every municipal budget and are funded today almost entirely by local property taxpayers. Restaurants and hotels add to those costs by bringing in patrons who live elsewhere. Dedicating a share of the revenue those patrons generate to the services they use lowers the amount each municipality must raise through the property tax.)
/Dest [30 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2531 0 R
/Prev 2588 0 R
/Next 2589 0 R
>>
