/Title (Adopt a delay rule to provide that any new mandates imposed on towns and cities take effect no earlier than one year \(12 months\) after enactment. This legislation would replace or amend the current five-month rule in CGS 2-32a \(as it relates to the default October 1 date set in CGS 2-32\).)
